{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9499408360e90444446ed2c2c80f162c2cb655e1f049636a4875838b0489639c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da4aea3735c213df11b476365135b12a9651038d8060d48d716a04d110d8557",
      "text": "我们是偶像！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c1167735aa7c72020846d1558c16a1c8208d3202ad578b23b36654d5900b38",
      "text": "出现在朱雀与玄武面前的，是前几天救助过的\n人物，同时也是偶像事务所的制作人。\n被对方提出“希望你们能参加成为偶像的\n试镜”后，朱雀与玄武给出的答案是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da4aea3735c213df11b476365135b12a9651038d8060d48d716a04d110d8557",
      "text": "我们是偶像！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f58d770a877612f38f64f25769bb4f93d48521c706d76fef99998bbf664ca6c",
      "text": "新出的松饼超——好吃的啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b588e682ea9bee87d8789d9b57ca58a684c19e8d5f5e38cd4abcc3cd70e5821",
      "text": "嘿嘿，玄武，\n今天能陪我来，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e9886c576b3abd93038b7969ad3684176bc328773d776fa068e9c5d8170e9c5",
      "text": "偶尔来一次也不错。不过还挺意外的。\n那帮家伙居然会知道那种店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4baedb70811368b2ca25174ee789c2beb3508e6b31e165b7a913dec1cade5bb",
      "text": "是啊，被找茬的时候，\n我还以为会变成什么样呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa9d9ef78c35e61c4497fd434523cb922bcb5ae01552ca91bfddccf2c55a3e2",
      "text": "真没想到他们居然是那么好心肠的家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66dce47fd87e7d15423ae05dd3be641e79ab0a2f377b669a5cadc8447647fb37",
      "text": "虽然嘴上说着助人为乐很无聊，\n但半路开始就主动上前搭话了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c0de221a8eb24b5680e835cca8e32201b4a74fce67375ff321f95d5a027dbe",
      "text": "而且后来聊起松饼的话题还挺投缘……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff080c1a9e2d924ddfbe1b6c4e95a9be279c31243bdad08428eb50abae61ca57",
      "text": "没打成架，\n就像画里一样圆满收场了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cfda1b82912495b3b0778c4e1827deecb606f05603c3a247acb9df21a14e040",
      "text": "大汤圆？\n虽然搞不太懂，但真的是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41840241f46701b9f41e93fa9f4c9ff12b277feb52e76a9b178d331ee4bd42e6",
      "text": "果然这世上就没有什么\n骨子里的恶人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90cf9ca6cb93c24a4e6abcb32a0e6b03d8d49d46a84cfc67fcaf29d04ee030a4",
      "text": "要是误入歧途了，\n就由我用狠眼神把他给纠正过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f519cc621084dbb7b4eea285fd055d31237204565d36b836af856968efa5112a",
      "text": "呵……不愧是朱雀。\n男人中的男人……不，是好汉中的好汉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c39658013f03251927ed0ec139f488eb1cf7689f867970636a40f8a0b68a2f75",
      "text": "勇往迈进。\n为了不愧对相棒之名，我也要一往无前！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:471c52f03c32447d776f02fce3aa5492450b14ece1a9103c9ce614e151046f08",
      "text": "嘿嘿，就该这样嘛！\n咕～燃烧起来了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67187a254d43ff7cdc5bb2ec468848751eb6029d4210db3d24d5b5823ab748fb",
      "text": "呐，玄武，待会儿\n要不要去巡逻？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c353c143197843fab5a38146cd9124e8c585fd629fb0d497645eb0ede5661e21",
      "text": "不了，抢包贼也抓到了。\n偶尔歇歇翅膀也很重要。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b0912583e5d1ce8a34d6e81c24689ae8a34df74093a1f62a1fd146aa88a53f",
      "text": "要是有其他想去的地方，我陪你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e23417f26dea087ca90b55ee5ae7d5fe82243cdebf05db730f40fe59f4a0651",
      "text": "可以吗？让我想想啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42d026b7160921c49f896795074b3917071974b0d3e04953428958f35d3df802",
      "text": "不对，老是我一个人定太不公平了，\n接下来去玄武想去的地方吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab811cab6585337ab9950e647d24549928e9dfa76a142d90cddc565e4b6cbe3",
      "text": "你喜欢博物馆对吧？\n去那里怎么样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5ef66b54180ebdd67bef7c240c1b4c67a56634371afdcf85d6d49aac2d205ef",
      "text": "……不了。等有朱雀可能喜欢的展览时，\n我再约你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8acefce69f5c71bd3765f8bccf2859d20a2caf089d6a879f9004d28eb267870a",
      "text": "现在的展览，好像是禁止携带动物的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8913e8d3fa04af118aabb8f6433e6d2425620c936d9c709ec9182db459acee05",
      "text": "喵～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86786df33dd77ee32627fa0e591dbb5f9ee037ed3be52d809ef82ade10d65ed2",
      "text": "……嘿嘿，原来是在为喵子考虑啊。\n谢啦，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db27e340c1ac34d331f784ca22a0ab186143e175b1dbdf450269c71f43f12580",
      "text": "是相棒的重要朋友，理所当然的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a0aa9241d8a20a0eb3293d7e6b8acd388b4388461e76655f6481fe98e3ff56b",
      "text": "哈哈！\n喵子也说谢谢你呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75cfa1821d0b0d18b3514bc3e02770f1eb813f4748d1fc60f2065e1d9ea9883d",
      "text": "那待会儿就去看衣服吧。\n像平时一样帮我挑挑衣服吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f0c2100cc239f72951531266c9d3dce6437034b3824e1364fc2207b62a2f401",
      "text": "咕～！闻到超香的包子味了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a6dc78035c9c7352ca16bba29a14484f48bec9e305c2835fd80e83054f388c",
      "text": "刚才不是才吃饱了松饼吗。\n还能吃得下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6fd884000e0efeec1ab144a9b008df92a2c616b451bc53a1fb4a2649076c836",
      "text": "闻到这么香的味道，\n肚子想不饿都难啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ac2ed0a1da4ab43f87af248f58a59b60eb97de0ff83bf142b909b7ace57f40",
      "text": "可是啊，待会儿还要去买衣服，\n零花钱……忍、忍耐啊忍耐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a9a3797db28fc98df6f53f4b242d1a74bf39c4f72940e853d027b95d6bb6cde",
      "text": "不行哦，喵子。就算你叫得这么想要，\n我也不会买的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3cff634cc297e498d0ee427702567ebce2d12dfbad0517d6282ad4f42ccb364",
      "text": "呵，看来这里是个危险地带啊。\n赶快穿过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:037f11eda0cac90b6ef7a765ae5539f70103bcc9fbfed5a6cc42c44e2eb32467",
      "text": "那个，不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc987764475d4e385f60b19ca9ee98137b250d5d57a76f8a39ab3ed706d8d501",
      "text": "啊？你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c29f2dfbf18dabc7dd282524accef2d7eecd9fbedec9368d8a8e83d7d92af8f",
      "text": "啊啊！是前几天那个拿杂志的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c19e159a74a9fa2989c46fc42850c92d1d6bb1ebc534879f77caf19384c53c66",
      "text": "你们好。前几天承蒙二位出手相助，\n真是非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a43822260aa55b81989ea996d20faee4693dcadb697d588248c5a6d28e06dd",
      "text": "在这种地方遇上还真巧啊。\n怎么了？又遇到什么困难了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3d1062838f765a2983343823fe7b187807e24f6541ed9848e7e32ac06d8f63",
      "text": "其实我是想见二位，\n一直在找你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba28efc28fca90a1bf3bb2e4d6264713306659b7666f4f1610ae1f601c2d9d1a",
      "text": "容我重新自我介绍，我是这家公司的！\n目前在偶像事务所担任制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaaedc406a58df826f50cba423b72371c32da5899967fc06fd0929108f4c29b3",
      "text": "三、一、五……Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a35c5792b43e454bf9674cdfd553391f22ae8392df03391b86283f8bb6aba0",
      "text": "是315 Production。\n还是一家刚刚起步的事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baf25fe0e0882ed4694e22b8f74d7220b6464730d067a6b3b781600251a75d42",
      "text": "偶像事务所的制作人，\n找我们有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d5f448c967dea108c78162227af3131846b0824a7e89b5bb6ce646d589cc3c5",
      "text": "朱雀先生、玄武先生，你们要不要试试\n参加成为偶像的试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a31af7c13714b9f2262979afeef2aa70e610060ae48f25992d5eb773dfb5acd",
      "text": "我和朱雀去当……偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83a569fcbad3dd9306763c25a5b76f15f2b8f84b3c872d8473c1f3986ae97d5",
      "text": "附近的家庭餐厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e91dc886d0c4af107e39ac13411beeebcda4faef9eb62992dc47d08209289ca",
      "text": "……喂、喂，玄武。他说我们当偶像，\n是认真的吗？话说为什么会挑中我们啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3486cc82cb8db10ae6863e78d61aa4dd436e24febb5e926ee8d8a9b1a22e19cc",
      "text": "……这种事我怎么可能会知道。\n至少这家伙看起来不像可疑人物就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64fd8f3dfe600745a7488be331fd029d46dd3c973b87e97073bd1a20596005f5",
      "text": "不好意思，占用了二位的时间。\n原本的安排没耽误吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80030d4aea45c59901b1ac15d20ee7d193f9c407554dc6fe12fec478842bc384",
      "text": "啊、啊啊，只是随便逛逛而已。\n不用在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b80b8b9f5ce1f5d5b6fc934146b7f6dc19eeac460fbaed792dad5c6f38fb2d9e",
      "text": "话说回来，谢啦！\n帮我们找了家喵子也能进的家庭餐厅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:581ff3ae55bb375f4263be2ed881a4b6a673c188fcd2a1b2c788b937ef4025f0",
      "text": "哪里的话。\n毕竟我也有事要找喵子商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284ebe3aa2a3ad3f51a3839a7db775c44f9c03e5451db50e93a7a022c636f469",
      "text": "找喵子也有事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8913e8d3fa04af118aabb8f6433e6d2425620c936d9c709ec9182db459acee05",
      "text": "喵～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d87df05737821f6969dd1951f9588edb8c0bb271754bab36da9a349618d8c4ae",
      "text": "刚才我也提到了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b511de20a5eee91c4e0668aff65af14d9d9d8e64078e17c9297b964ba50ddb7",
      "text": "朱雀先生、玄武先生、喵子。\n要不要来参加偶像试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9a55d25da3daf2114c0778be9d7315fe3d3e59e02042c55f05f03817e2e631",
      "text": "哈啊！？喵子也要！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ad4df6c65f48f984588877f7036468ec002d3c43af76ba01b7b9fa2a93fb33c",
      "text": "（……虽然说了些异想天开的话）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d597bb7ab107891a97f662d9d67f254e4380babacace8fbd5a3a6793bf59373",
      "text": "（但眼神看起来不像是说谎……\n先听听看再说吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:142f16f4d1906055969045607c6784e0fbebd137721953708fbb1eb9720ae148",
      "text": "根、根本就搞不懂\n偶像到底是个什么玩意儿啊！喂，玄武！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b8362459a7da816e40a3d37942e2da3bb890b6bd883381d081c4fbbce0f42b0",
      "text": "冷静点，朱雀。……喂，之前也说过了，\n我们对偶像并不了解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79a6fd20ada26fa9d1941cadc1cebd87b2bc4c376508c3fcf623b5d908f7f971",
      "text": "偶像这行，到底是要做些什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e55fcca5d84f5822b627a3f29a45639b3b2d1b52d667a665ce782bbc2e65ffd",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:897f76610bd556766a995858ff09dcf62bdcb3aa2b4bed0cf29da1b1e0bd5b1a",
      "text": "……偶像这行，\n涉及的事情比我想象的还要多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6548fab2b0ddca372db4e4d651305fbe8a742a3686da0a4442f89d81c4271e2f",
      "text": "……喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f2c8ad98be132e88db5429368bfc9a839251844e2284d9272f95f250fc943af",
      "text": "刚才的话里，\n你说过偶像能上电视对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50346246c17f1ca2b6d4eb47c8c66daead823069531e1296210f5009dcacef6a",
      "text": "是的！不仅是电视，\n还能在其他各种媒体上露面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c4aaa2e2ba0228bd8ffd143b9e59f45bea09bc1ebd2e5278386ce1cdb5b3454",
      "text": "这样啊，也是啊。\n毕竟偶像要做的事情很多嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5631d6e37e427320dff8da755f1d4db2ec93b2f6c198640becebc5109f20f1ee",
      "text": "你这家伙，对电视感兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:182c4ae6bfc2a7279bb3cdac091f49a3b7d7b45f7b9a2901f8b8c97617b3518e",
      "text": "没，也不是感兴趣……\n我老爸老妈不是摔角手嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58e615a3eb4281452e9b66ff6262c0eaae1a2868f00fcdc60d1cecc67b27f91e",
      "text": "他们俩在电视里打倒的都是坏蛋角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5aeb9289d9c244c03ca63f6c4843f87ca3ecc979d94a530cd570d11ac61c808",
      "text": "但为什么不去打倒真正的坏蛋呢，\n我从小就一直看不惯这点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de8fd04adf242b9c8140e7268f3176bd68e0f4d6a4e0474382ce7ab16a7ebb9",
      "text": "明明换作老爸他们的话，\n不管是多厉害的坏蛋都能打倒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b96a49e0f5abb00799915578cfc0f8b27133834f513bfa521696b2060acccf",
      "text": "朱雀……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcb34cd07e18b470a52c8caedaf4c6a2128d21938c7163b0a7c59bb54c590d5",
      "text": "所以就总觉得有点在意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef7de0795969539609e75bf113d3e2ceb6f79e13996cb52eec4097b524bdff43",
      "text": "（嗯？不过这么说来，这不就是我上电视\n打倒真正恶徒的好机会吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f66e0e3fc8d9dc460af8d322752f86a602f8f85312b327c2752120eefcd49b9d",
      "text": "（我正好觉得光凭一双拳头直接去退治恶人，\n根本就治不过来呢……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ced0dd83d721e0536a0193c0d17d0c73a57d0d567dab9be76144407f6ea7e553",
      "text": "（要是上了电视，就能和无数的恶势力战斗了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d648b2424735392e781c8bb17f35f92e62039462ab32561337f633465bf6d128",
      "text": "喂，玄武！我们一起上电视，\n隔着电视狠狠瞪过去吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554df9ed789204bc58048f97b49d97ba7b872abdf5abce85061d05dd19806bd5",
      "text": "我们去当能把那帮恶人\n吓得瑟瑟发抖的偶像吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e287a5a2f6e1faa69a48f7d6a3b144761d497623c50ad0d341313a234d9ca6d",
      "text": "你这家伙，是认真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89fb69e3fec0b7b6a51829175f7b6b0d131dfe1bcd5a5aaf2af88a120130bfdf",
      "text": "废话，认真得不能再认真了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:592b61da26fb52affa2181b4993593720d835eb90ac747dafb4c619d0ebd66d4",
      "text": "听了●●●●プロデューサー的话，\n我的心就像着了火一样热血沸腾啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df44ec2a75bb432564f893f66767b79a62afd5549591795aea0a7fdd872ff3c",
      "text": "要想让世上不再有恶人，\n就只有这个办法了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79eaf03e728e40825cb82950dce997ee3c0788a01a3bd9ea4d77b75d9b55bea4",
      "text": "（……很像朱雀会有的想法。云蒸龙变。\n借着这股势头作为偶像登顶，还是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d0eabc7d044dfce1ba75d5eef407f71ae24809177d5df45e744670e0774fe3f",
      "text": "玄武，我觉得只要和你一起就办得到！\n拜托了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e282e4fe243707c71e74dc6912c2e0c9275954b47c669d6f262b75ef11b4fa",
      "text": "……被相棒说到这个份上\n要是还拒绝，那就不算男人了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ad5a1e26643213365b68d593a61a260c262f4241990f691b982fdbb17da21db",
      "text": "我黑野玄武，就陪你一起去参加\n315 Production的试镜吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc5a6322b76059d665f3210daabf93dd4d37c8841ec55e8b60a7c729561e68c",
      "text": "玄武……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28bd052102d0b1701e829653b88a89df1a4d11922f3f283fe5b89b4cc4dfe346",
      "text": "喵喵喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0eb4b49a25c2a913eb9b92efaa0e6209549a28bf3b4c2f3c88df31770a19ea0",
      "text": "啊啊，喵子也一起！\n呜喔喔喔，燃起来了！Burning！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a134ed10d2b6a042488a9a2fc8e1954f7347bc359f32a1f7e270e2d4665fd840",
      "text": "朱雀和喵子都拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f2362c0ac3d821efdaa012da8a0c922fa1acf0909f92ab102ff4fb5ccad204",
      "text": "我们才要请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eb3de0cd113ad0e3f5a5e0ba53adcce223e7e4e3540e10d753c0663485be28c",
      "text": "回见啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我很期待试镜哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6718218a87f540e5db657401ab1895bc579d719e37539adc4c4f49c5f3fe9d5a",
      "text": "好的！今天非常感谢二位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d863c81114c52f9c2b15989a40acb8c4a0784adcfe53b3e336d370c762b1512b",
      "text": "我们当偶像啊……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c894f6bc2d842e605b28823ccf99d7a65040fe7d4ddece50dd6777e1af5a50a6",
      "text": "这么说来，我们也要穿\n那种闪闪发光的衣服了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b8366aeb6b263cb5420b614d5efbb540a1ac7de6c2a7bd5863cd49a3651ca2a",
      "text": "衣服的事我不知道，反正不管怎样，\n也得等试镜合格了再说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ff43385b6025fc70c1981a457a1c8eda3d6ba05d8bc7d06177373976e2b48b9",
      "text": "我们在偶像这方面只是门外汉。\n要是掉以轻心可是会吃大亏的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0dcb0dcce05c4d4c6894f7f574a342013d830c03bdd42f5379c9fe45b5ef25",
      "text": "门外汉确实是门外汉，\n但心头的热血可不会输给任何人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15241fabffc688672d89ec48b229b05e037d26166140b84440f985b48bd3eee1",
      "text": "我们的话一定能合格！\n喵子也这么觉得吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_02_1_1_009_02:1_1_009_02_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d723a6fbc9576c40f5727c921b01aa50a0d46ec50446e2f6999a22e8377226a",
      "text": "说的也是……慧可断臂，\n既然要做，就一定要通过给你看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
